{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばちは\n私！スノボめっちゃできます！！自分で言うなって言われるかもしれませんが、めっっちゃくちゃ上手です！！\n佐々木久美です🦒くみてんです🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WJSG62VWNHY40QDBP51K8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WJTNCZ7JA313Y26PAZQSQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">寅女です、跳び箱楽しかったな🕴めいちゃんの年賀状もらったので私もハッピータイガーな一年になりそうです🐯"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はRayの発売日です🤍今月はグラビア風のお写真盛りだくさんです〜\nぜひお手にとってくださると嬉しいです☁️"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WJVNX2TTZDRPT3NQZ9JHS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WJWWB9VAST5EE3MKNYFX9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WJY3NSBK0ZV3EPAGYP6YM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WJZ4HWXTCWZXT96D25MGJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WK06XJTA0F855QM023PAQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WK17DRECB5WZJDDT8CTJP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WK273P95R43X8238V3C52","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nこれは先月号のオフショットです！フィルムカメラでカメラマンさんが撮ってくださりました🐶#KUMIFILM"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WK3AE9D4JCZXMZMESWEQP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WK4DGRFNRMMHED8XNA4JC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WK5E2AEGMRB1X4EPMVDV7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WK6FWFJNAGPB9KE6EHAMK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WK7HSVVY2YMKJ1ZP0EX1H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">これは今月号のオフショット〜💠お花で笑顔で誰かを叩こうとしてるみたいに見える最後の写真がお気に入りです（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、22日21時からSHOWROOM配信します👾何をするってわけではないのですが、歳を重ねるし、、みなさんとお話ししたいなと思って、、ぜひ遊びに来てください〜！今から緊張ぎみ😶‍🌫️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}